"可执行文件，可在任何 Linux "
"发行版上运行。``sibuna_<version>-1_amd64.deb``、``sibuna_<version>-1_arm64.deb``、``sibuna-<version>-1.x86_64.rpm`` "
"和 ``sibuna-<version>-1.aarch64.rpm`` 会连同一个 systemd "
