#~ msgid ""
#~ "Only the component that terminates TLS sees the ClientHello, so only "
#~ "it can compute JA4. Sibuna does not terminate TLS: it serves plain "
#~ "HTTP/1.1 behind an ingress, and the ingress speaks TLS, HTTP/2 and "
#~ "HTTP/3 with browsers. Several ingresses compute JA4 already. We "
#~ "therefore let the ingress compute the fingerprint and send it in a "
#~ "request header, and Sibuna reads it from there."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "只有终止 TLS 的组件才能看到 ClientHello，因此只有它能计算 JA4。Sibuna 不终止 TLS：它在入口代理之后提供普通的 "
#~ "HTTP/1.1 服务，由入口代理与浏览器使用 TLS、HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 通信。已经有几种入口代理能够计算 "
#~ "JA4。因此，我们让入口代理计算指纹并通过一个请求头发送，Sibuna 从该请求头中读取它。"

